{
  "name": "mn-ws",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "description": "HTTP 与 WebSocket 双向桥的客户端半：把本机 nx 服务桥给远端 HTTP 客户端",
  "type": "module",
  "//main": "**没有 main / exports** —— 这个包是个 CLI 工具，不是库。发布物是「原生二进制 + React 构建产物」，没有 JS 入口可导入。（0.6.x 时代有 dist/index.js，那是 Node 时代的 client 半，现在由 Rust 二进制取代。）",
  "bin": {
    "mn-ws": "./bin/mn-ws.exe"
  },
  "files": [
    "bin",
    "web"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "start": "pnpm build && node scripts/run-local.mjs serve",
    "dev": "node --import tsx scripts/dev.mjs",
    "dev:serve": "node --import tsx src/runtime/cli.ts serve --no-open",
    "link:local": "node scripts/link-local.mjs",
    "unlink:local": "node scripts/link-local.mjs --unlink",
    "build": "tsc -b tsconfig.node.json && vite build",
    "build:rust": "cargo build --release --manifest-path ../rust/Cargo.toml",
    "build:dist": "pnpm run build:rust && node ../scripts/install-rust-bin.mjs client",
    "typecheck": "tsc -b tsconfig.node.json tsconfig.web.json",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "test:smoke": "node tests/smoke.mjs",
    "test:unit": "node --import tsx --test \"tests/unit/*.test.ts\" \"tests/unit/*.test.mjs\"",
    "test:cross": "node --import tsx tests/cross-compat.mjs && node --import tsx tests/cross-compat-reverse.mjs",
    "test:panel": "node tests/panel-check.mjs",
    "test:layout": "node ../scripts/verify-client-layout.mjs",
    "test:e2e": "node tests/e2e-remote.cjs",
    "test": "pnpm run lint && pnpm run typecheck && pnpm run build && pnpm run test:smoke && pnpm run test:unit"
  },
  "//dependencies": "运行时**零依赖**：包里的东西是原生二进制 + React 构建产物，不需要 npm 装任何运行时依赖。",
  "//devDependencies": "react/react-dom/ws 只在构建期用（vite 打进产物里）。mn-ws-server 是**交叉兼容测试的对照物**（TS 版的 server 半，验证旧版 client 能连新版 server）—— 它不再发布到 npm，所以放 devDependencies（本地 workspace 链接）。",
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "@types/react": "^19.0.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.0.0",
    "@types/ws": "^8.5.13",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^4.3.0",
    "eslint": "^10.0.0",
    "mn-ws-server": "workspace:*",
    "react": "^19.0.0",
    "react-dom": "^19.0.0",
    "tsx": "^4.19.0",
    "typescript": "~5.9.0",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.71.0",
    "vite": "^6.0.0",
    "ws": "^8.18.0"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/On-DevPlan/mn-ws.git",
    "directory": "client"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/On-DevPlan/mn-ws#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/On-DevPlan/mn-ws/issues"
  }
}
